# FX revaluation journal (SFRS 21)
FXRevaluationSection = FX revaluation journal (OD)
FXRevaluationDate = Revaluation date (period end)
GenerateFXRevaluation = Generate FX revaluation entry
ConfirmGenerateFXRevaluation = This posts a journal entry for open multicurrency customer/supplier invoices at the closing rate. Continue
FXRevaluationGenerated = FX revaluation entry created (%s bookkeeping lines)
FXRevaluationNothingToDo = No open multicurrency receivables/payables to revalue
FXRevaluationAlreadyExists = An FX revaluation entry already exists for %s
FXRevaluationLabel = Unrealised FX revaluation as of %s
FXRevaluationNote = Scans open multicurrency customer and supplier invoices and posts ONE aggregated OD journal entry retranslating them at the closing rate (SFRS 21 / IAS 21). Differences go to the FX gain/loss accounts configured above. One entry per date; to reverse a period, delete the FXREV piece in the journal.

